        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko Dawidi yari yavuze ati “Uwiteka Imana ya Isirayeli ihaye ubwoko bwayo ihumure kandi iba i Yerusalemu iteka ryose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guteg 10.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi Abalewi ntibazaba bacyongera guheka ihema n'ibintu byakorewe umurimo waryo byose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagambo ya Dawidi yaherutse ni yo yatumye Abalewi babarwa, abari bashyikije imyaka makumyabiri n'abayishagije, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.3.5+NUM.3.6+NUM.3.7+NUM.3.8+NUM.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 3.5-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kuko umurimo wabo wari uwo gufasha bene Aroni mu murimo w'inzu y'Uwiteka mu bikari no mu byumba, n'iyo bezaga ibintu byera byose, n'iby'umurimo bakoraga mu nzu y'Imana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi n'imitsima yo kumurikwa imbere y'Imana, n'ifu y'ingezi yo gutura amaturo y'ifu y'impeke, ay'udutsima tudasembuwe, n'ay'ibyakarangwaga ku byuma, n'ay'ibirunzwemo amavuta, n'iby'indengo n'imibyimba bitari bimwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no guhagarara uko bukeye bagashima, bagahimbaza Uwiteka kandi na nimugoroba bakabigenza batyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no gutambira Uwiteka ibitambo byoswa byose, ku masabato no ku mboneko z'amezi no mu birori byategetswe, nk'uko umubare wabyo wari uri ukurikije amategeko yabyo, (bigakorwa) ubudasiba imbere y'Uwiteka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no kurinda ihema ry'ibonaniro aho barindishijwe, n'Ahera aho barindishijwe, n'ibya bene Aroni bene wabo barindishijwe, ngo bajye bakora umurimo wo mu nzu y'Uwiteka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
